[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-IRS003
TITLE: Aircraft and airport TOML schema
STATEMENT: >>>
The configuration file shall contain exactly the tables aircraft, performance, airport, runway, ramp, and option. aircraft shall carry n_number, facility, next_facility, and next_frequency_mhz in the range 118.000 to 136.975. performance shall carry taxi, rotation, and pattern speeds in increasing order, pattern altitude, takeoff and landing distances, turn rate, acceleration, vertical speed, and a low-approach height below pattern altitude. runway shall carry an identifier from 01 through 36 with optional L, C, or R, a heading from 0 through 359, length, left or right pattern, hold-short distance, pattern offset, and an upwind distance beyond the departure end. option.choice shall be full_stop, touch_and_go, stop_and_go, or low_approach. Extra keys and missing keys shall be errors. Acceptance is config/n123ab.toml loading and an empty file, a bad pattern, and a frequency of 100.0 being rejected.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
One closed schema keeps a misspelled key from looking like a valid aircraft.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Interface
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
